GE/Siemens diffusion correction maps (NCANDA human phantoms)

Voxelwise correction maps between NCANDA's GE and Siemens scanners, derived from
NCANDA human phantom scans.

Files: <measure>_GE_Siemens_<method>.nii.gz
  measure: fa, md, l1, lt
  method:  local_mul, local_add, local_avg_mul, local_avg_add,
           local_avg_whole_mul, local_avg_whole_add

The diffusion pipeline applies these only when the site code in a visit's
measures/demographics.csv is A or D. They are specific to NCANDA's scanners:
do not apply them to other data.
